        {
          "type": "minecraft:item",
          "name": "minecraft:written_book",
          "weight": 1,
          "functions": [
            {
              "function": "minecraft:set_components",
              "components": {
                "minecraft:written_book_content": {
                  "title": "Chem Thrower Field Report",
                  "author": "A Happy Lab Rat",
                  "pages": [
                    "{\"text\": \"CHEM THROWER FIELD TRIAL: FINAL REPORT\\n\\nCorporate sent us their \\\"revolutionary\\\" chem thrower to test. Nobody volunteered.\\nThen they mentioned our bonuses.\\nEverybody volunteered.\"}",
                    "{\"text\": \"Infernium works. Point it at the vines and the vines stop being a problem. Point it at the jungle and the jungle becomes a clearing.\"}",
                    "{\"text\": \"Point it near a worker napping on shift, for \\\"motivation,\\\" and his eyebrows become a memory. He has not slacked off since.\"}",
                    "{\"text\": \"Tried it on dinner. One quick blast and a whole crate of rations, cooked through in two seconds.\\nAlso the crate. And the table.\\nDinner was crunchy.\"}",
                    "{\"text\": \"Something big came sniffing round the ore carts at night. One long burst and it left in a hurry, screaming.\\nThe ore carts also left. Melted, mostly.\"}",
                    "{\"text\": \"Infernium is just lava, boiled into gas in a vaporizer and sealed into aluminum tanks. Simple.\\nExcept we have no lava out here. And no press.\\nSo when the tanks run dry, they're dry.\"}",
                    "{\"text\": \"Final verdict: clears brush, scares monsters, cooks dinner, motivates staff.\\nRecommend for field use.\\nBonus, please.\"}"
                  ]
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
